It reads, at run time, the Azure DevOps REST API specifications from MicrosoftDocs/vsts-rest-api-specs, as preserved
by the Software Heritage archive (https://archive.softwareheritage.org/). Those files are not included in this
repository. Their repository's LICENSE file reads "MIT License, Copyright (c) 2018 Microsoft Docs"; its
ThirdPartyNotices file states that documentation content is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 and code
under MIT. Manuals generated from them copy operation and parameter descriptions from those files.

It also reads, at run time, Microsoft's Azure DevOps client libraries microsoft/azure-devops-go-api
(https://github.com/microsoft/azure-devops-go-api) and microsoft/azure-devops-node-api
(https://github.com/microsoft/azure-devops-node-api), both MIT License, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. Those
files are not included in this repository. Manuals generated with them copy method, parameter and type descriptions
from those files.

With a PAT, it reads the Analytics service's OData metadata ($metadata) and the route lists of the user's own
organization; manuals generated from them copy entity, property and route names from those answers.

Request-side corrections to the specs follow the ones made by vsts-api-patcher in
microsoft/azure-devops-rust-api (https://github.com/microsoft/azure-devops-rust-api), MIT License,
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.

